                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5428cc94-73d2-3a1a-94c6-fd4e32ba4a21",
                        "entry_id": "dd958447-f14f-3034-80eb-adc323ee282e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "филос., истор. в древнегреческой философии — эстетическое переживание при просмотре трагедии"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0b7fdf1-0772-4f25-a9ad-272e0ae4c7df",
                                "sense_id": "5428cc94-73d2-3a1a-94c6-fd4e32ba4a21",
                                "text": "Аристотель, желая основать эстетику самое по себе, избегая привносить в нее элементы религиозного чувствования, изображает катарсис, как целительное освобождение души от хаотической смуты поднятых в ней со дна действием трагедии аффектов, преимущественно аффектов страха и сострадания."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0eb0fd04-8a41-3df9-b5dd-4f5707e23ed1",
                        "entry_id": "dd958447-f14f-3034-80eb-adc323ee282e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. духовное и нравственное очищение, просветление, обычно возникающее в процессе сопереживания и сострадания при восприятии произведения искусства"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bbee6d9-e7c5-4be0-b995-0a2218e49342",
                                "sense_id": "0eb0fd04-8a41-3df9-b5dd-4f5707e23ed1",
                                "text": "Любовь ― это очищение страстей, катарсис, это счастливое, но все-таки наивысшее напряжение всех человеческих сил."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2331611f-4a30-4fc7-ab27-51627e3c1d08",
                        "source_entry_id": "dd958447-f14f-3034-80eb-adc323ee282e",
                        "target_lang_word": "catharsis",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "catharsis",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d983c96e-9178-320e-9963-ba0a3f3b54a9",
                                        "entry_id": "f6eef12e-c5ed-32b1-8700-a486e6c93652",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A release of emotional tension after an overwhelming vicarious experience, resulting in the purging or purification of the emotions, as through watching a dramatic production (especially a tragedy)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "424516e7-6c2a-4b03-b8e1-d49215fe9ea1",
                                                "sense_id": "d983c96e-9178-320e-9963-ba0a3f3b54a9",
                                                "text": "True, as the show has entered its later years, there have been more inspired moments of catharsis, but fewer unpredictable arcs and story beats, as a narrative nearing its conclusion is no longer attempting to shock."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3a4445d-fc1c-3b13-b761-d70168249a55",
                                        "entry_id": "f6eef12e-c5ed-32b1-8700-a486e6c93652",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any release of emotional tension to the same effect, more widely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b14e344-fb97-385d-95b2-01b4c25c5b1b",
                                        "entry_id": "f6eef12e-c5ed-32b1-8700-a486e6c93652",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A purification or cleansing, especially emotional."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf32f36c-f6cb-300c-b0a6-24df5865248f",
                                        "entry_id": "f6eef12e-c5ed-32b1-8700-a486e6c93652",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A therapeutic technique to relieve tension by reestablishing the association of an emotion with the memory or idea of the event that first caused it, and then eliminating it by complete expression (called the abreaction)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8ac0828-4a85-3ec9-a7c2-b32ee2ad687c",
                                        "entry_id": "f6eef12e-c5ed-32b1-8700-a486e6c93652",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Purging of the digestive system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
